    "text": "<p>In the figure is shown a system of four capacitors connected across a <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>&nbsp;battery. The charge that will flow from switch S when it is closed is:<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/189ed71b-cab7-4c8c-b43b-bf0d887cae42-image.png\" style=\"width: 234px; height: 200px;\" /></p>",
    "image": null
  },
